Kubernetes deployment into a Helm chart

Step 1: Create Helm Chart Directory
CMD:  helm create (Application Name)
      cd (Application Name)
Step 2: Customize the Helm Chart
Step 3: Package the Helm Chart
CMD: helm package (Application Name)
     (Application Name)-0.1.0.tgz
     mv(Application Name)-0.1.0.tgz helm-chart.tgz
Step 4: Deploy to AKS with Helm
CMD: az aks get-credentials --resource-group (Resource Group) --name (Cluster Name)
     helm install sample-app-release helm-chart.tgz --values  (Application Name)/values.yaml | tee helm-deploy-logs.txt
Step 5: Validate the Deployment
CMD: kubectl get pods -l app=(Application Name)-release
     kubectl get svc
     curl http://<EXTERNAL-IP>
